    "long_instructions": "# Iterate & Refine\r\n\r\nUse Web Lab to improve your app based on feedback and what you learned from testing.\r\n\r\nOpen `capstone.md` and review your **Feedback Log** and **Testing Log** before making changes. Then ask yourself:\r\n- What is the most important thing to fix or change right now?\r\n- What feedback should I act on — and what should I set aside for now?\r\n\r\nNot every piece of feedback needs to become a change. Deciding what not to change — and being able to explain why — is part of good design.\r\n\r\nDecide how you want to use AI Tutor to help you make changes — whether that's updating the layout, restyling a section, fixing a behavior, or adding a new interaction. \r\n\r\nAs you work, update your **Feedback Log**, **Testing Log**, and **AI Use Log** in `capstone.md`.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Use Web Lab to build and test a working version of your app. Return to this level whenever you need to test or iterate on your app as it evolves. ***(supports completing Milestone 3)***.",
